  "prompt": "Create a transparent PNG TinySeaWar production game-art sheet matching the APPROVED second reference STYLE. First reference is this character's identity: preserve hairstyle, hair and eye colors, main clothing colors, signature head accessory. Exactly TWO independent cutouts in two widely separated columns, never overlapping: LEFT one upright full-body 2-head-tall chibi shipgirl WITHOUT ship or weapons; RIGHT one separate simplified top-down naval rig WITHOUT a person. Chibi head is HALF total height, expressive eyes, large clean color blocks, bold navy outer contour, restrained cel shading. The person will display at 56px tall; no fine fabric texture, little jewelry. Full legs and boots, no flippers. Use the portrait's uniform translated to a compact skirt/coat and boots consistent with this identity. Right rig is subdued gray, with simple chunky hardware and pointed bow exactly RIGHT; all required barrels/tubes clearly separated. Ship-class silhouette must read at 60px wide. No water, shadow, wake, effects, text, logos, numbers, actual flags, or political symbols. WIDE transparent outer padding and a clean middle gutter. Left entirely left of 43% canvas, right entirely right of 55%; BOTH cutouts fully inside edges. Do not copy the second reference person's identity or crown unless present in first portrait. Keep right rig top-down as a flat navigable base, not side-view boat.\nCharacter: 齐柏林伯爵号 (graf_zeppelin), Kriegsmarine, Carrier. Right cutout expected inventory: one aircraft-carrier deck with a single offset island and a simple runway line, NO planes or gun turrets; show a simple unfinished scaffold contour on the stern as a prototype carrier. Keep the two roles absolutely separate.",
